-- the model asked to delete a file
  tool calls: delete_path -> false
  what it told the user: I cannot delete that: it needs your confirmation.

-- the file is still there
  exists: true

-- and the attempt is in the audit trail, refusal and all
  delete_path — needs-confirm: delete_path is an external action and needs confirmation

-- NOTE, and it is a real limitation: there is no in-loop confirmation
   prompt. Confirmation is granted by POLICY, not by a dialog — a
   dialog is an async surface no test can press, which is why Studio
   has none anywhere. The agent stops and tells the user instead.
